{"kp_id": "zj-006.kp0001", "video_id": "zj-006", "type": "treatment_principle", "statement": "按时辰规律发病，取该经荥穴或输穴（甲乙经）；二者皆可有效。", "entity_ids": ["new.book.针灸甲乙经", "new.concept.五输穴", "meridian.lu"], "chapter_id": "zj-006.c01", "evidence_quote": "按照那那个我讲的这个东西是那个针灸甲乙经来的", "seg_from": 1, "seg_to": 10, "start_s": 2.84, "end_s": 64.325, "citation": {"youtube_id": "Soxee0YjneA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Soxee0YjneA&t=2s", "series": "zj", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 06", "start_s": 2.84, "end_s": 64.33}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-006.kp0002", "video_id": "zj-006", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "原穴用于五脏不平衡；阳经皆有原穴。", "entity_ids": ["concept.yuan_xue"], "chapter_id": "zj-006.c01", "evidence_quote": "元穴呢是按五脏用的，五脏不平衡的时候用的", "seg_from": 55, "seg_to": 57, "start_s": 288.73, "end_s": 310.645, "citation": {"youtube_id": "Soxee0YjneA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Soxee0YjneA&t=288s", "series": "zj", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 06", "start_s": 288.73, "end_s": 310.64}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "元=原", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-006.kp0003", "video_id": "zj-006", "type": "treatment_principle", "statement": "季节取穴例：冬刺井；味觉嗅觉问题多取合穴（应秋令）。", "entity_ids": ["new.concept.五输穴"], "chapter_id": "zj-006.c01", "evidence_quote": "冬天的时候我们刺颈穴", "seg_from": 59, "seg_to": 102, "start_s": 317.06, "end_s": 525.38, "citation": {"youtube_id": "Soxee0YjneA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Soxee0YjneA&t=317s", "series": "zj", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 06", "start_s": 317.06, "end_s": 525.38}, "confidence": 0.8, "asr_note": "颈穴=井穴", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-006.kp0004", "video_id": "zj-006", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "取穴以任督为基准定位，可减少找错穴。", "entity_ids": ["meridian.cv", "meridian.gv"], "chapter_id": "zj-006.c02", "evidence_quote": "就是按照任任督二脉做个基准，以它来做标准", "seg_from": 214, "seg_to": 216, "start_s": 1105.471, "end_s": 1124.911, "citation": {"youtube_id": "Soxee0YjneA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Soxee0YjneA&t=1105s", "series": "zj", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 06", "start_s": 1105.47, "end_s": 1124.91}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-006.kp0005", "video_id": "zj-006", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "会阴为任脉起点，可向心脏方向深刺；列缺通任脉，急救可开窍。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.cv1", "acupoint.lu7", "meridian.cv"], "chapter_id": "zj-006.c02", "evidence_quote": "任脉的第一个穴道", "seg_from": 279, "seg_to": 299, "start_s": 1449.401, "end_s": 1564.006, "citation": {"youtube_id": "Soxee0YjneA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Soxee0YjneA&t=1449s", "series": "zj", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 06", "start_s": 1449.4, "end_s": 1564.01}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-006.kp0006", "video_id": "zj-006", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "十三鬼穴（人中、少商、隐白等）用于神志异常、所谓鬼魅妄见。", "entity_ids": ["new.method.鬼穴", "acupoint.gv26", "acupoint.lu11", "acupoint.sp1"], "chapter_id": "zj-006.c02", "evidence_quote": "我们就下鬼针啊、人中啊、哨商啊，这样隐白啊", "seg_from": 308, "seg_to": 308, "start_s": 1611.471, "end_s": 1624.466, "citation": {"youtube_id": "Soxee0YjneA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Soxee0YjneA&t=1611s", "series": "zj", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 06", "start_s": 1611.47, "end_s": 1624.47}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "哨商=少商", "source": "llm_read"}
